---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Seeds — What's Growing"
  description="What Pamoja is growing next, and what the tree needs: space, flexible multi-year trust-based funding, and institutional capacity — an investment in a shared community, not a donation request."
  currentSection="seeds"
>
  <section class="page-head wrap">
    <p class="tag">Seeds · What's Growing</p>
    <h1>What's growing.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Every gathering Pamoja has grown came from seed: a yard offered, a
      grant trusted, a partner's time lent. This page names what the next
      season needs — and what an investment in a shared community actually
      looks like.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap ask" aria-labelledby="ask-heading">
    <h2 id="ask-heading">The ask.</h2>
    <p>
      This is not a donation request. It is an invitation to invest in a
      community you belong to — to put something into the shared dish that
      the whole city eats from.
    </p>
    <div class="ask-grid">
      <article class="ask-card">
        <h3>Space</h3>
        <p>
          Free or low-cost venues where gatherings can root — a room, a yard,
          a hall that sits empty on weekday evenings. Space is the difference
          between a plan and a gathering.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="ask-card">
        <h3>Flexible, multi-year, trust-based funding</h3>
        <p>
          Funding that trusts the people doing the work: multi-year, lightly
          restricted, sized to the work rather than to a funder's calendar.
          The Dish With One Spoon, practised at the level of budgets.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="ask-card">
        <h3>Institutional capacity</h3>
        <p>
          Legal, financial, and administrative strength lent from
          organizations that have it — for example, a legal or financial
          team's time toward incorporation. Expertise shared is capacity
          built.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap examples" aria-labelledby="examples-heading">
    <h2 id="examples-heading">What a successful partnership looks like.</h2>
    <ul class="example-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Co-hosting a community meal</strong> — your organization's
        people cooking and eating alongside the community's, as guests and
        co-hosts, not sponsors at a distance.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Lending a professional team's time toward incorporation</strong> —
        a legal or financial team's hours, given as capacity the collective
        keeps.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Sharing unused space</strong> — a venue that stands empty
        becoming common ground for a season or longer.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Helping with a crowdfunding campaign</strong> — reach,
        matching, and credibility lent to a campaign the community runs.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap cta-block" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
    <h2 id="cta-heading">Plant something with us.</h2>
    <p>
      If you have space, funding, capacity, or something we haven't thought to
      ask for — the first step is the same as always: a conversation.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/contact">Start a conversation →</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-block: 3rem 2rem;
  }
  .page-head h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: var(--max-prose);
  }

  .ask {
    padding-block: 2rem;
  }
  .ask-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr));
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .ask-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--leaf);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .ask-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
  .ask-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .examples {
    padding-block: 2rem;
  }
  .example-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: var(--max-prose);
  }
  .example-list li {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--paper-warm);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--tea);
  }

  .cta-block {
    padding-block: 2rem var(--space-section);
  }
  .cta-link {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
</style>
